WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.900
<b>Fall...</b>

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:11.310
By defeating you,

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:14.510
I can make Grandfather
Kurokage's dream a reality.

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:17.950
A world of pure good,
without black or white...

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:21.410
A world where everyone can be happy.

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:23.030
Yumi-chan,

00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:26.260
if there was a world of only good,

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:29.300
do you think that there's any kind
of person who could be happy there?

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:32.520
I do believe that.

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:36.550
Conflict occurs because
there is good and evil.

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:40.560
And that conflict is what
creates hatred and sadness.

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:44.320
Then what about shinobi
who can't live as good shinobi?

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:47.310
If they can't live that way, they must die.

00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:49.930
They have to die because
they live differently than you?

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:52.690
That's absurd!

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:56.190
That sounds like something someone
who's friends with evil ninjas would say.

00:00:56.430 --> 00:01:00.200
I never thought that you and I
could understand each other.

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:02.780
Once we fight,

00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:05.210
we'll know who is right.

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:14.960
Light and shadow,

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:16.340
good and evil.

00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:17.920
Yin and yang...

00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:21.300
All of them exist as pairs!

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:27.480
So what?

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:30.750
My grandpa said

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:34.770
that the world only works because
there's light and shadow.

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:37.100
And I agree.

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:39.620
There are lots of people in this world.

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:41.970
If there was only one kind of person,

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:45.160
no one would be truly happy.

00:01:47.150 --> 00:01:49.790
My parents were good ninjas

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:52.630
who died in battle with evil ninjas.

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:55.500
Shiki-san and Minori-san, too...

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:58.640
Yozakura-san and Murakumo-san,
they're all the same!

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:02.520
The existence of good and evil
took our parents from us!

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:05.540
Asuka-san,

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:10.240
do you think your logic means anything
to someone who lost their parents?

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:15.640
Logic can't change people's hearts.

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:21.030
We can't let anybody
else suffer like we did.

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:22.200
So...

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:24.990
When a good ninja like you tries
to get along with evil ninjas...

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:27.040
Asuka-san,

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:29.900
we can't let you get away with it!

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:52.060
<b><i>Sen</i></b>

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:52.810
<b><i>Ran</i></b>

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:53.520
<b><i>Kagura</i></b>

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:53.860
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:56.030
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:56.030
<b><i>- Tokyo Youma Chapter -</i></b>

00:04:08.170 --> 00:04:10.050
What are the rules for the final match?

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:11.890
There are none, really.

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:16.110
The last battle is a pure test of strength.

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:17.650
Asuka-san...

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:19.710
I'll ask you again.

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:22.130
Now that you know everything,

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:25.210
will you still fight me?

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:28.410
What does she mean by "everything"?

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:48.760
I'll tell you when we win.

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:53.100
Then I definitely can't lose.

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:56.160
Step back, Fubuki-sama.

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:58.270
We'll handle them.

00:04:58.270 --> 00:05:01.390
Shinobi transformation!

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:15.630
You're an embarrassment
to your grandfather!

00:05:16.360 --> 00:05:17.660
Why?

00:05:18.110 --> 00:05:20.960
Conflict occurs because
there is good and evil.

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:23.340
And that conflict creates hatred.

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:27.930
You abandoned
Kurokage-sama's philosophy.

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:30.990
A world of only good,
with no black and no white.

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:33.180
A world where everybody
can be happy...

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:34.820
We'll be the ones to make that world.

00:05:34.820 --> 00:05:39.690
You don't understand 
Grandfather Kurokage at all, Gekkou-san!

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:42.940
What are you talking about?!

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:45.870
When he was younger,

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:49.600
Grandfather Kurokage was a cruel
shinobi who allowed no evil to exist.

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:51.040
But...

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:51.870
Juju!

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:54.120
Come forth!

00:06:00.820 --> 00:06:01.710
What's this?

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:03.090
Go!

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:29.330
Well?

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:31.000
You can't touch me.

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:33.240
With my justice I'll destroy both evil

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:36.680
and the youma!

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:37.870
The youma?

00:06:45.260 --> 00:06:47.380
So that's it.

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:49.170
Pay attention!

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:52.990
You're being used!

00:06:52.990 --> 00:06:55.020
Me? By who?

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:58.730
Shut up!

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:08.900
Shinobi students all over the world,

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:13.320
this is the power of someone
who keeps true justice in their heart!

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:15.520
Those who turn to evil,

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:17.360
those who deal with evil,

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:21.660
and those who let the word "justice"
stop them from fulfilling their duties...

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:24.670
Everyone, wake up.

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:27.700
True justice is power.

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:34.690
And the purpose of the Shinobi Masters
tournament is to make that plain as day!

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:40.350
Juju!

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:48.590
Yumi-senpai...

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:49.700
Why?

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:54.690
Didn't you hate evil,
 just like Kurokage-sama did?

00:07:54.690 --> 00:07:57.440
People and the world can both change.

00:07:57.440 --> 00:07:59.960
Is that wrong?

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:03.810
I think it's okay for them to change.

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:07.010
If it's right, and meaningful...

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:11.840
Even if Grandfather Kurokage
believed differently.

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:15.720
You're making a
mockery of his beliefs.

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:18.520
And I'll make you pay for it!

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:21.520
Yumi!

00:08:26.260 --> 00:08:28.060
What's a youma doing here?

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:31.140
Don't ask me!

00:08:31.140 --> 00:08:34.290
We need to save the Hanzo girls.

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:36.440
There's just one youma.

00:08:36.440 --> 00:08:38.260
Do we break through it?

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:39.310
Homura-chan,

00:08:39.310 --> 00:08:41.310
it's dangerous to charge straight in.

00:08:41.310 --> 00:08:43.290
The Hanzo girls could get hurt.

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:45.290
Then what do we do?

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:48.270
Get behind it and kill it.

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:51.800
I researched the layout
of the stadium. We could do it.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:18.690
Suzune-sensei, don't just stop.

00:09:18.690 --> 00:09:19.510
Wait.

00:09:19.510 --> 00:09:20.990
This is unexpected.

00:09:22.340 --> 00:09:24.330
What's this sound?

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:27.710
The duct's screaming.

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:29.580
It's saying you weigh too much.

00:09:29.580 --> 00:09:31.770
That's rude!

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:34.500
We mostly eat grass,
so how could we weigh—

00:09:34.960 --> 00:09:35.850
Huh?

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:38.140
This isn't good!

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:39.840
We're going to fall!

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:49.350
Juju?

00:09:55.810 --> 00:09:59.370
The battle isn't over.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:03.710
I'm going to stay true
to Kurokage-sama's beliefs.

00:10:04.420 --> 00:10:07.150
And make the whole world good!

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:13.500
So I can't lose to you here!

00:10:16.830 --> 00:10:18.090
Wait!

00:10:19.310 --> 00:10:20.850
It's not over.

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:23.090
The battle isn't over yet.

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:25.770
Yumi-chan?

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:31.490
I'm going to stay true to 
Grandfather Kurokage's beliefs.

00:10:31.490 --> 00:10:34.160
And make the whole world good!

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:36.110
So I can't lose to you,

00:10:37.180 --> 00:10:42.360
a girl who is friends
with evil ninjas, here!

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:44.610
If we keep this up,

00:10:44.610 --> 00:10:46.940
one of us will die.

00:10:47.530 --> 00:10:49.580
That's what a battle is.

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:52.640
I don't mind fighting.

00:10:52.640 --> 00:10:54.950
I want to be a shinobi, after all.

00:10:54.950 --> 00:10:56.060
But...

00:10:56.060 --> 00:10:57.120
But you know...

00:10:57.580 --> 00:11:00.580
I don't want to just fight you.

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:03.260
I want to talk more.

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:09.040
I want to hear more about
how you feel about justice.

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:11.770
We could just go talk over tea at a café.

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:13.770
Asuka-san...

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:17.420
You really are a good person.

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:21.530
But even so,

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:22.540
I...

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:29.340
Grandfather Kurokage is sick.

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:30.780
He only has a few months to live.

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:33.290
I have to make his wish come true!

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:36.630
I have to honor his wishes!

00:11:41.120 --> 00:11:42.610
Grandfather?

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:55.610
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:55.610
<b><i>- Tokyo Youma Chapter -</i></b>

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:07.530
She's still standing?

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:09.530
How?!

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:15.550
A good ninja must
not befriend an evil one.

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:18.610
All evil must be destroyed.

00:12:18.610 --> 00:12:21.130
No evil may exist in this world.

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:25.550
Kurokage-sama's beliefs are our guide!

00:12:25.860 --> 00:12:27.800
They are now, and they always will be.

00:12:29.670 --> 00:12:32.300
From the outside, our lives at Gessen,

00:12:32.300 --> 00:12:34.420
the place where the
shinobi elite are trained,

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:37.820
must have looked perfect.

00:12:40.630 --> 00:12:46.310
But our hearts were unfulfilled.

00:12:59.230 --> 00:13:01.710
This meeting must be...

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:03.090
<b>Kurokage's
 Diary</b>

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:05.840
<b>Kurokage's Diary</b>

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:04.590
...fate.

00:13:09.410 --> 00:13:13.310
It was a record of Kurokage-sama's battles,

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:16.110
against all the evil ninjas he'd fought alone.

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:22.820
It was like awakening from a slumber.

00:13:27.710 --> 00:13:29.790
A path that is pure and unwavering,

00:13:30.350 --> 00:13:33.870
and so difficult to follow.

00:13:34.970 --> 00:13:36.860
Pure justice.

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:41.540
This was our goal!

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:47.010
Why...

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:50.510
Why are you crying too, Yumi-senpai?

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:55.210
Grandfather Kurokage told
us about his time as a shinobi when

00:13:55.750 --> 00:14:00.040
we decided to go to Gessen.

00:14:01.530 --> 00:14:05.530
I wasn't going to tell you this.

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:08.170
But if you're going to enter
the world of the shinobi,

00:14:08.170 --> 00:14:10.110
you'll learn someday.

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:13.930
So I'll tell you everything myself.

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:19.200
All of us had lost our
parents to evil shinobi,

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:24.050
so we had no doubt
about the things he did.

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:26.210
We all talked about it.

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:29.490
We said we'd follow the path
of justice when we were shinobi,

00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:31.060
just like he did.

00:14:31.290 --> 00:14:33.800
Then why...?

00:14:33.800 --> 00:14:37.040
Why won't you join us?

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:39.690
Someone told me...

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:41.750
That the only reason
everyone can be happy

00:14:41.760 --> 00:14:43.810
is because there are
many different kinds of people.

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:46.320
And that's...

00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:48.280
...what justice is.

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:54.450
Senkou!

00:15:03.140 --> 00:15:06.300
Miyabi, relax.

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:08.120
It was luck.

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:10.450
Yeah, we just had bad luck.

00:15:11.150 --> 00:15:12.280
Imu,

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:14.820
now's the time to analyze
the cause of our defeat.

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:17.360
Don't just write it off as bad luck.

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:20.470
I'm just trying to make Miyabi feel better.

00:15:20.470 --> 00:15:23.790
Licking each other's wounds
is just a waste of time.

00:15:23.790 --> 00:15:25.690
I think so, too.

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:27.980
Oh? For once we actually agree.

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:30.860
Now's not the time for licking
each other's wounds.

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:34.250
It's the time for licking
each other's bodies!

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:35.900
Lick, lick, lick!

00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:37.000
Ryona, wait!

00:15:38.150 --> 00:15:39.140
Stop!

00:15:39.140 --> 00:15:41.250
I'm so jealous...

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:43.250
I mean, stop.

00:15:46.530 --> 00:15:50.240
Why do I get licked on the forehead?

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:50.230
Stupid dog!

00:15:50.230 --> 00:15:52.510
Knock it off!

00:15:53.350 --> 00:15:54.300
What?

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:58.800
Don't tell me you're
going to lick me, too.

00:15:58.800 --> 00:16:00.760
Nope.

00:16:01.090 --> 00:16:05.600
I want you to lick <i>me</i>!

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:07.020
Come on!

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:09.490
Hell no!

00:16:12.260 --> 00:16:14.690
What are you smiling about, Murasaki?

00:16:14.690 --> 00:16:16.050
I'm happy.

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:19.040
We're all back to normal.

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:21.540
Right?

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:24.800
You've got me there.

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:27.410
Ryona, thank you.

00:16:27.410 --> 00:16:28.890
Without you,

00:16:28.890 --> 00:16:33.160
our team unity might've collapsed.

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:37.720
It feels like <i>something's</i>
about to collapse.

00:16:40.980 --> 00:16:42.310
Ow...

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:44.220
Miyabi?

00:16:44.220 --> 00:16:45.700
What are you doing here?

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:46.930
That's <i>my</i> question to ask.

00:16:46.930 --> 00:16:47.840
Perfect.

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:49.870
Suzune-sensei, you too?

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:53.360
Hebijo and Homura's Crimson Squad
 are going to work together.

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:54.810
A youma has appeared.

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:00.830
Youma,

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:04.330
you're giving back the Hanzo girls.

00:17:05.390 --> 00:17:07.840
It's working so far.

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:09.550
Just like we planned,

00:17:09.550 --> 00:17:11.340
we'll get behind the youma.

00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:14.340
<i>Not yet, Homura.</i>

00:17:14.980 --> 00:17:16.530
<i>Just a little more...</i>

00:17:16.530 --> 00:17:18.930
<i>Get a little closer...</i>

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:20.590
<i>Almost there.</i>

00:17:22.360 --> 00:17:23.600
<i>Okay! Now!</i>

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:27.360
You shinobi seem quite talented.

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:29.610
The youma... talked?

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:31.310
Impossible!

00:17:32.300 --> 00:17:34.130
What's going on?

00:17:41.020 --> 00:17:41.820
Senkou!

00:17:43.440 --> 00:17:44.830
We're not done yet.

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:47.280
If they get us, we just get them back.

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:49.710
Don't forget Kurokage-sama's teachings.

00:17:50.020 --> 00:17:51.970
If they get us, we just get them back.

00:17:52.720 --> 00:17:54.090
Right!

00:17:57.230 --> 00:17:58.340
Asuka-san?

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:01.600
I'll stop them, so you finish this.

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:02.350
Right!

00:18:35.930 --> 00:18:37.920
The battle's over, huh?

00:18:38.140 --> 00:18:39.350
Asuka-san!

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:53.980
Grandfather Kurokage...

00:18:58.210 --> 00:18:59.680
Enough.

00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:01.250
You've done enough.

00:19:01.250 --> 00:19:02.860
You're so sick.

00:19:02.860 --> 00:19:04.220
Why did you come here?

00:19:04.220 --> 00:19:07.950
Living with you taught me that there are

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:11.220
more important things
in life than your beliefs.

00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:13.720
Yumi...

00:19:14.470 --> 00:19:16.820
You are my light.

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:21.550
Grandfather Kurokage...

00:19:24.590 --> 00:19:27.870
We've lost this battle.

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:31.400
No, I lost.

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:32.320
What?

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:36.320
There was a world of pure good.

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:38.450
Where?

00:19:38.790 --> 00:19:40.060
Right there.

00:19:40.890 --> 00:19:44.720
In your arms, Kurokage-san.

00:19:45.970 --> 00:19:47.620
Yes...

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:49.070
I suppose you're right.

00:19:52.660 --> 00:19:56.610
It was... there all along.

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:02.690
The definition of justice changes

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:05.080
depending on who you
are and what you do.

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:06.430
So Yumi,

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:10.650
you will be a justice that
shines quietly in the darkness.

00:20:10.650 --> 00:20:13.000
The justice of the moon.

00:20:19.630 --> 00:20:21.650
Become the justice of the moon.

00:20:22.300 --> 00:20:26.200
That was his last lesson for me.

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:27.730
The justice of the moon?

00:20:27.730 --> 00:20:31.060
You know, the moon doesn't
stand out like the sun does.

00:20:31.060 --> 00:20:32.120
So you see,

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:35.370
justice shouldn't stand out either, right?

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:40.290
It means pancakes covered
in cream and honey are wonderful,

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:44.120
but pancakes with just
butter are good, too.

00:20:44.120 --> 00:20:46.610
Minori-chin, that's not quite right.

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:48.680
It's not?

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:50.680
Asuka-san...

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:56.900
Your words helped 
Grandfather Kurokage rest in peace.

00:20:56.900 --> 00:21:00.720
I'll never forget how grateful I am to you.

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:01.990
So...

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:03.400
This time...

00:21:05.630 --> 00:21:08.660
I will fight Fubuki-san.

00:21:08.950 --> 00:21:10.620
What are you saying—

00:21:11.440 --> 00:21:12.710
Asuka-san?!

00:21:13.390 --> 00:21:16.770
Gekkou-san and Senkou-san's attacks

00:21:16.770 --> 00:21:19.480
have pushed Asuka-san's
body to its limits.

00:21:19.480 --> 00:21:20.670
But still...

00:21:20.990 --> 00:21:23.530
I'm in her debt.

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:29.170
And I always want to repay my debts.

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:32.330
That is my own...

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:38.640
"If they get you, get them back."

00:21:44.440 --> 00:21:47.200
But then there's no point...

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:54.630
I worked so hard to stop
you two from fighting!

00:23:26.610 --> 00:23:28.130
Just like humans...

00:23:28.130 --> 00:23:29.160
The youma are?

00:23:29.160 --> 00:23:32.260
That youma smells like a human.

00:23:32.260 --> 00:23:34.800
She's also your...

00:23:34.800 --> 00:23:39.100
I will win this battle and create
a new justice for shinobi.

00:23:39.530 --> 00:23:40.980
Ice Queen!
